== Unlocking Races ==
Races can be unlocked by completing their respective achievement in the Races subsection of Untapped Potential achievements.

Each race will have a list of factions that you will need to get maximum faction with to unlock the race. They are usually the town guards, merchants, and one of the class factions. You are automatically granted the achievement if you start as that race and you can use Race Unlock Tokens (not yet implemented) to bypass them.

The achievements work by checking your completion of the faction specific achievements that can be found in EverQuest > Progression in the achievement menu. You gain these achievements by achieving +2000 personal faction with the associated faction.

You do not need all the factions maxed at the same time to unlock the achievement. 

